# study-room-service - deploy/env/studyroom.env (copy from this file; never commit the real one).
# Only what study-room-service reads at runtime and compose does NOT set. Compose already sets the wiring
# (ports, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_*, RABBITMQ_URL, *_GRPC_URL, JWT_*, SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET) from deploy/.env.
# Empty KEY= lines are required values; commented lines are optional tunables with their default.

# Nothing secret: FRONTEND_URL (WebSocket CORS), Redis, the broker user `studyroom`, the auth gRPC URL and the
# service token are wired by compose. There is no ROLE variable: one process serves HTTP, Socket.io and the consumer.
